A quote-prefixed plus takes one space after each quote marker and attaches a quote

```
> +
q
.
<blockquote><p>q</p></blockquote>
```

```
> > +
q
.
<blockquote>
  <blockquote><p>q</p></blockquote>
</blockquote>
```

```
>+
q
.
<p>&gt;+
q</p>
```

```
>>+
q
.
<p>&gt;&gt;+
q</p>
```

```
> >+
q
.
<blockquote><p>&gt;+
q</p></blockquote>
```

```
>> +
q
.
<p>&gt;&gt; +
q</p>
```

```
> q
>+
> para
.
<blockquote><p>q
&gt;+
para</p></blockquote>
```

```
> > q
> +
> > r
.
<blockquote>
  <blockquote>
    <p>q</p>
    <blockquote><p>r</p></blockquote>
  </blockquote>
</blockquote>
```

```
> - a
> +
> > r
.
<blockquote>
  <ul>
    <li>a
      <blockquote><p>r</p></blockquote>
    </li>
  </ul>
</blockquote>
```

```
> > - a
> +
> para
.
<blockquote>
  <blockquote>
    <ul>
      <li>a</li>
    </ul>
    <p>para</p>
  </blockquote>
</blockquote>
```

```
> a
> +
> > q
.
<blockquote>
  <p>a
+</p>
  <blockquote><p>q</p></blockquote>
</blockquote>
```
